{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中原地產成和道第一分行高級資深分區營業經理許妙嫦表示，分行新近促成跑馬地樂陶苑租賃成交，單位為D座低層12室，實用面積1,103平方呎，採用3房1套間隔，望綠林景，最新以5.6萬元租出，折合實用呎租約50.8元。<br/>據了解，業主於2004年以710萬元購入單位，持貨22年，是次出租可享約9.5厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:47.499167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:47.083566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:40.855577+00:00","content_hash":"8e6ab12ebcb7a201aab3cc461aabe821b910b2182cccd17a66045fb7983a3584","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}